<title>UK: London precious metals end nervous day mixed.</title>
<headline>London precious metals end nervous day mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $348.80/$349.30 vs $351.95/$352.45 previously. Under pressure from dollar, weaker technicals. Swiss plan to sell gold undermining sentiment.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended at $5.19/$5.21 up two cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished down a dollar at $379.50/$380.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed up $0.50 at $148.50/$149.50.</p>
